|---|---|---|\
| **Neural networks** | An attractor basin in weight space (a diagram of gradient flows converging) | A specific weight matrix |\
| **Quantum mechanics** | A symmetry (a group action on Hilbert space) | A specific state vector |\
| **Langevin dynamics** | The invariant measure (the fixed point of the Fokker-Planck operator) | A specific trajectory |\
| **Programming** | A type (an object in a CCC) | A specific value of that type |\
